$sectorsEn=(PageHero 'SECTORS' 'Technology shaped around the organization.' 'Sector context changes the constraints, language, users, data, and risk. We adapt the solution to each environment.')+'<section class="section"><div class="container"><div class="grid three"><article class="card" id="professional"><h2>Professional services</h2><p>Public websites, client portals, documents, approvals, communication, and billing support.</p></article><article class="card" id="construction"><h2>Construction and real estate</h2><p>Work orders, field apps, inspections, maintenance, document control, and reporting.</p></article><article class="card" id="manufacturing"><h2>Manufacturing</h2><p>Production software, quality checks, equipment integrations, inventory, maintenance, and reports.</p></article><article class="card" id="retail"><h2>Retail</h2><p>E-commerce, mobile experiences, inventory, purchasing, product information, and customer workflows.</p></article><article class="card" id="health"><h2>Health and wellness</h2><p>Websites, scheduling, client communication, and administrative tools with appropriate privacy.</p></article><article class="card"><h2>Any other sector</h2><p>We work with businesses, nonprofits, teams, and organizations wherever a well-designed digital solution can help.</p></article></div></div></section>'
